

**Cluster Autoscaler:** Existing node group ke andar nodes ko **add/remove** karta hai.

**Karpenter:** Workload ki requirement ke according **directly suitable EC2 node provision/remove** karta hai.

👉*CA = Node Group based | Karpenter = Workload based**






+-------------+     +------------+     +----------+     +--------------+     +---------+     +------------------+     +----------+
| EKS CLUSTER | --> | KARPENTER  | --> | NODEPOOL | --> | EC2NODECLASS | --> | AWS EC2 | --> | NEW WORKER NODE | --> | PODS RUN |
+-------------+     +------------+     +----------+     +--------------+     +---------+     +------------------+     +----------+



